<title>CHINA: C.Lyonnais sets warrants on petrochemicals basket.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets warrants on petrochemicals basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Friday it launched 900 million American-style call warrants on a basket of petrochemical stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Shanghai Petrochemical Co Ltd	  0.17</p>
<p>shrs</p>
<p> Jilin Chemical Industrial Co Ltd     0.23</p>
<p>shrs</p>
<p> CNPC Hong Kong Ltd			 0.30 shrs</p>
<p> Zhenhai Refining &amp; Chemical Co Ltd   0.13 shrs</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$1.6532     PREMIUM	 16.1 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$0.0746     GEARING	 2.77x</p>
<p> LAUNCH DATE	25.JUL.97     MIN EXER LOT  20,000</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	 25.JUN.98     LISTING	 HONG KONG</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT   HK$2.0665     LISTING DATE  14.AUG.97</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW    HONG KONG     PAYDATE	 12.AUG.97</p>
<p> NOTE		 PHYSICAL OR CASH SETTLEMENT AT ISSUER'S</p>
<p>			DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
